  "Question": "There are 46 storybooks, and 20 are borrowed. How many books remain? Calculate: \\(46-20=?\\)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "26",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(46\\) has 4 tens and 6 ones. Subtracting \\(20\\) removes 2 tens, leaving 2 tens and 6 ones. \\(46-20=26\\). So 26 books remain.",
